<title>SWITZERLAND: G10 discussed Japan - Tietmeyer.</title>
<headline>G10 discussed Japan - Tietmeyer.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank president Hans Tietmeyer said that the Group of 10 discussed the situation on Japanese financial markets, but he declined to specify whether they drew any conclusions.  </p>
<p>Asked whether the Group of 10 central bank governors committee had discussed the situation on Japanese financial markets, Tietmeyer told reporters:</p>
<p>&quot;We have discussed that, but it is up to the Japanese to say how they see it.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
